  Kinetic (Delta T^0):                   0.567317177149502         15.4375           356.00          1489.49
  Delta V^Pauli Coulomb:                -0.428651494034892        -11.6642          -268.98         -1125.42
  Delta V^Pauli LDA-XC:                 -0.114135440017819         -3.1058           -71.62          -299.66
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Exchange:            0.031779252364266          0.8648            19.94            83.44
